- op: discuss  # 4c7f
  at: '2026-10-18T01:41:49Z'  # 4c7f
  by: agent  # 4c7f
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 4c7f
  clock: 3  # 4c7f
  nonce: 4c7f  # 4c7f
  message: "Satisfied in PR #1705 (dev c9cbe576ea). wolfram.py: a call on the left-hand side of the nearest enclosing := / = (a definition head, a pattern inside it, a Part target) emits no edge; a call is anchored on the function symbol of the definition whose body contains it (by position), else the file; dedup is per (source, callee); .m files go through find_wolfram_files as the analyzer's _find_source_files. Behavioral evidence (test_wolfram.py::TestWolframDefinitionsAreNotCalls, ::TestWolframDotMFilesAreAnalyzed): before the fix 'f[x_] := x + 1 / h[z_] := z / q[x_] = x' produced calls file -> f, h, q and a Wolfram-classified math.m produced no symbols; after, no calls edge from those three, g[x_] := Sin[x] gives one edge g -> builtin Sin, main[x_] := helper[x] resolves main -> helper, and math.m yields its 'square' function while a MATLAB func.m yields nothing."  # 4c7f
